  "description": "In-memory storage provider and testing utilities for Vali-Blob — the unified cloud storage abstraction library for .NET.\n        Provides InMemoryBlobProvider, a fully functional IBlobProvider implementation backed by a ConcurrentDictionary,\n        designed for unit and integration tests without any real cloud dependency.\n        Drop-in replacement for any Vali-Blob provider — swap with a single DI registration call in your test setup.\n        Targets netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net6.0, net7.0, net8.0, and net9.0.",
